Reviewed `src/blog/people/drafts/caseoh.md` and appended the FRESH EYES REVIEW block at the bottom (no prior block existed). No body edits made.

The two biggest issues:

1. **The Sketch defense is buried.** The main body's thesis is "silence is how this man handles everything sharp," but the one time he did charge into a firestorm — publicly backing Sketch within hours of the July 2024 exposé — lives only in the Rabbit Hole wing paragraph. Fans know this moment, and it's actually the strongest version of the thesis: he can't defend himself, but he will defend his people. It deserves a main-body beat next to the LosPollosTV silence.

2. **The draft never shows what he actually streams.** His brand is obscure indie-horror and rage-game reactions plus Just Chatting chaos, but the body only names NBA 2K, Hogwarts Legacy, and childhood Call of Duty. It also misses a free thematic collision: the man who sleeps with a salt lamp because darkness unsettles him screams at horror games for a living.

Also flagged: the "Losing My Mind" marathon contradiction (the comfort-built man voluntarily choosing endurance-test content) is the draft's one rounded-off ambivalence; the salt lamp is used three times; FAQ 1 and the diagnosis section spoil the dad-phone-call reveal the TL;DR deliberately teases; and there's TikTok-thin evidence of a current gym/weight-loss arc worth verifying before publish since it would give "Maybe When I Was Younger" a present-tense beat. The chill litany, the phone-call section, and the childhood two-scene synthesis are marked keep-as-is.

Sources: [TwitchTracker played games](https://twitchtracker.com/caseoh_/games), [EarlyGame on his variety/horror mix](https://www.facebook.com/earlygamegg/posts/caseoh-is-known-for-variety-streaming-horror-games-indie-titles-just-chatting-an/1174477868224940/), [Tuko bio on his private relationship status](https://www.tuko.co.ke/facts-lifehacks/celebrity-biographies/561558-caseohs-girlfriend-weight-house-net-worth-earnings/), [TikTok weight-loss clip](https://www.tiktok.com/@qualitycaseoh/video/7517299230432595231).
